{"id":"4d66b7028c04efe8","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-levy-subordinator.md","title":"Lévy Subordinator","display":"df-levy-subordinator — Lévy Subordinator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-levy-subordinator","aliases":["58-df-levy-subordinator"],"display":"df-levy-subordinator — Lévy Subordinator","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-subordinator.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-levy-subordinator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-levy-subordinator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-levy-subordinator — Lévy Subordinator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b44df7aeba18e12f\" href=\"?note=b44df7aeba18e12f\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-subordinator.md\">../batch08/58-df-subordinator.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V\">\\(T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subordinator}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Subordinator}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b44df7aeba18e12f\" href=\"?note=b44df7aeba18e12f\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-subordinator.md\">../batch08/58-df-subordinator.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LevySubordinator}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{LevySubordinator}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}levy\\text{-}subordinator} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{LevySubordinator}_S(T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Subordinator}_S(T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}levy\\text{-}subordinator} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{LevySubordinator}_S(T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Subordinator}_S(T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Subordinators have Laplace transforms given by Bernstein functions.</li>\n<li>The probability-space parameters are explicit and agree with the upstream four-place subordinator predicate.</li>\n<li>They are used in option pricing models.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-subordinator.md","status":"resolved","id":"b44df7aeba18e12f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-subordinator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-subordinator.md","status":"resolved","id":"b44df7aeba18e12f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Subordinator}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-subordinator.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subordinator}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LevySubordinator}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}levy\\text{-}subordinator} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{LevySubordinator}_S(T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Subordinator}_S(T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)","display":true}],"bytes":917,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-774","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-levy-subordinator.md|58-df-levy-subordinator]]（batch14）"}